#: ../../source/sqd.md:1
msgid "Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "基于采样的量子对角化（SQD）"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:3
msgid ""
"SQD prepares a CCSD-seeded LUCJ state with ffsim, samples determinants, and solves the "
"Hamiltonian in the recovered subspace with qiskit-addon-sqd. The public workflows return an "
"`SQDResult`. Its reference and comparison energies use the same Hamiltonian. This is a classical "
"simulator implementation. It does not demonstrate quantum advantage or execution on quantum "
"hardware."
msgstr ""
"SQD 使用 ffsim 制备以 CCSD 为种子的 LUCJ 态，采样行列式，并使用 qiskit-addon-sqd 在恢复的子空间中求解哈密顿量。公开工作流返回 "
"`SQDResult`，其中参考和对照能量使用同一哈密顿量。这是经典模拟器实现，不能证明量子优势或量子硬件执行。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:9
msgid "Installation and platform"
msgstr "安装与平台"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:11
msgid "Use this source checkout on Linux x86_64 for the SQD implementation and examples:"
msgstr "在 Linux x86_64 上使用此源码仓库运行 SQD 实现和示例："

#: ../../source/sqd.md:19
msgid ""
"The public supervisor requires Linux x86_64 because it uses `/proc` and `multiprocessing` with "
"`fork`. The supervisor rejects other platforms before execution."
msgstr "公开监督执行器使用 `/proc` 及带 `fork` 的 `multiprocessing`，因此要求 Linux x86_64。它会在执行前拒绝其他平台。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:23
msgid ""
"SQD requires ffsim and qiskit-addon-sqd. Catalyst is optional. Add `--extra catalyst` only when "
"you also use Catalyst workflows. The unified `uv.lock` resolves PySCF 2.14.0 even for a core-only"
" locked checkout. The prior core environment used 2.11.0. This also affects shared QPE/MM "
"dependencies, so an old core environment is not equivalent to a fresh locked install."
msgstr ""
"SQD 要求 ffsim 和 qiskit-addon-sqd。Catalyst 为可选项。仅在同时使用 Catalyst 工作流时才添加 `--extra catalyst`。统一 "
"`uv.lock` 即使对仅含核心依赖的锁定源码环境，也解析为 PySCF 2.14.0。先前核心环境使用 2.11.0。这也影响共享 QPE/MM 依赖，因此旧核心环境不等同于全新锁定安装。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:29
msgid ""
"The measured profile is Linux x86_64, Python 3.12.3, NumPy 2.4.1, SciPy 1.16.3, ffsim 0.0.84, "
"Qiskit 2.5.2 and qiskit-addon-sqd 0.13.1. The resource certification does not cover other "
"platforms or arbitrary dependency versions. Catalyst may be absent. If Catalyst is installed, its"
" version must still match the calibration environment. Version checks still apply to all required"
" numerical packages."
msgstr ""
"实测配置为 Linux x86_64、Python 3.12.3、NumPy 2.4.1、SciPy 1.16.3、ffsim 0.0.84、Qiskit 2.5.2 和 qiskit-"
"addon-sqd 0.13.1。资源认证不覆盖其他平台或任意依赖版本。Catalyst 可以不安装；如果安装，其版本仍必须与校准环境一致。全部必需数值软件包仍须接受版本检查。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:36
msgid ""
"For a guided progression through every maintained example, use the [SQD showcase "
"tutorial](tutorials/sqd-showcase.md). Public signatures and typed contracts are listed in [SQD "
"API reference](api-reference/sqd.rst)."
msgstr ""
"按顺序学习全部维护中示例，参见 [SQD 展示教程](tutorials/sqd-showcase.md)。公开签名和类型契约见 [SQD API 参考](api-"
"reference/sqd.rst)。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:40
msgid ""
"Ordinary `import q2m3` still imports PennyLane. The SQD algorithm does not call PennyLane or "
"Catalyst. SQD workflow exports load on access. Without the extra, they raise `ImportError` with "
"the installation command. To check availability, test `\"run_sqd\" in q2m3.__all__`. Do not use "
"`hasattr`, because it can trigger that error. Configuration/result types do not import ffsim or "
"Qiskit."
msgstr ""
"普通 `import q2m3` 仍导入 PennyLane。SQD 算法不调用 PennyLane 或 Catalyst。SQD 工作流导出在访问时加载。缺少可选依赖时，它们抛出带安装命令的 "
"`ImportError`。检查可用性时，测试 `\"run_sqd\" in q2m3.__all__`。不要使用 `hasattr`，因为它可能触发该错误。配置和结果类型不导入 ffsim "
"或 Qiskit。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:47
msgid "Two runnable public entry points"
msgstr "两个可运行的公开入口"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:49
msgid ""
"Save either Python block as a file. After the installation above, run `uv run --no-sync python "
"FILE.py`. Both use H₂ at 0.74 Å/STO-3G, explicitly `(2 electrons, 2 spatial orbitals)`, or four "
"system qubits. The small 128-shot smoke case uses seed 31 and two LUCJ repetitions. It reaches "
"the full four-determinant space. Agreement with CASCI is a regression check, not evidence that "
"sampling outperforms classical solvers."
msgstr ""
"将任一 Python 代码块保存为文件。完成上述安装后，运行 `uv run --no-sync python FILE.py`。两者均使用 0.74 Å/STO-3G 的 H₂，并显式指定 "
"`(2 electrons, 2 spatial orbitals)`，对应四个系统量子比特。小规模 128 次采样冒烟案例使用种子 31 和两次 LUCJ 重复，达到完整的四行列式空间。与 "
"CASCI 一致属于回归检查，不能证明采样优于经典求解器。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:56
msgid "The geometry entry point builds integrals and a same-frame CCSD seed:"
msgstr "几何入口构建积分及同轨道框架的 CCSD 种子："

#: ../../source/sqd.md:79
msgid ""
"The integral entry point accepts already assembled chemist-order tensors. This example uses the "
"guarded producers to supply authenticated frame and CCSD data. `host_available_mb` is a "
"conservative memory cap, not a request to allocate that much memory. Here, currently available "
"Linux memory bounds it."
msgstr ""
"积分入口接受已组装的 chemist 顺序张量。本示例使用具有资源保护的生成函数，提供经过认证的轨道框架和 CCSD 数据。`host_available_mb` "
"是保守内存上限，不是要求分配等量内存。此处以当前 Linux 可用内存限制它。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:118
msgid ""
"Both examples yield approximately −1.13728383449 Ha in the measured profile. "
"`run_sqd_from_integrals` requires `context`. Bare `t1`/`t2` arrays are not an accepted substitute"
" for `CCSDSeed`. These inputs are checked:"
msgstr ""
"在实测配置中，两个示例均得到约 −1.13728383449 Ha。`run_sqd_from_integrals` 要求 `context`。裸 `t1`/`t2` 数组不能替代 "
"`CCSDSeed`。将检查以下输入："

#: ../../source/sqd.md:122
msgid "shape"
msgstr "形状"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:123
msgid "finite values"
msgstr "有限数值"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:124
msgid "balanced electron counts"
msgstr "平衡电子数"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:125
msgid "Hamiltonian/frame identity"
msgstr "哈密顿量 / 轨道框架标识"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:126
msgid "HF/CCSD energy"
msgstr "HF/CCSD 能量"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:127
msgid "CCSD residuals"
msgstr "CCSD 残差"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:129
msgid ""
"Failed or unconverged seeds raise an error. For a deliberate baseline-only run, set "
"`mode=\"reference_only\"` (and `seed_data=None` at the integral entry). The workflow never "
"silently substitutes HF for a failed SQD run."
msgstr ""
"种子失败或未收敛时抛出错误。有意仅运行基准时，设置 `mode=\"reference_only\"`，并在积分入口设置 `seed_data=None`。工作流绝不会静默用 HF 替代失败的 "
"SQD 运行。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:133
msgid "Fixed orbital frame and MM embedding"
msgstr "固定轨道框架与 MM 嵌入"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:135
msgid ""
"Coordinates, including `mm_coords`, are in Å. `mm_charges` are in elementary charges. Energies "
"and integral constants are Hartree. The high-level entry accepts both MM arrays and "
"`embedding_mode=\"diagonal\"` (default) or `\"full_oneelectron\"`. The latter requires MM "
"charges. The vacuum MO frame and two-electron tensor stay fixed. Diagonal mode adds only diagonal"
" active one-electron terms. Full mode also retains off-diagonal terms."
msgstr ""
"坐标包括 `mm_coords`，单位为 Å。`mm_charges` 单位为元电荷。能量和积分常数单位为 Hartree。高层入口接受两组 MM 数组，以及 "
"`embedding_mode=\"diagonal\"`（默认）或 `\"full_oneelectron\"`。后者要求 MM "
"电荷。真空分子轨道框架和双电子张量保持不变。对角模式仅添加活性空间对角单电子项，完整模式还保留非对角项。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:142
msgid ""
"All solver arms share the same active span, Hamiltonian, frame and core constant. `e_core` "
"already includes the MM nuclear contribution: do not add it again at the low-level entry. The "
"low-level `h2` is chemist ordered and is not transposed again. In an embedded fixed frame, "
"`hf_energy` is the reference determinant expectation, not a relaxed embedded SCF minimum. Static "
"MM and the H₂O adapter are verified. SQD MC integration, correlated RDM feedback and polarizable "
"MM are outside this delivery."
msgstr ""
"全部求解器分支共用相同活性子空间、哈密顿量、轨道框架和核心常数。`e_core` 已包含 MM 核贡献：不要在底层入口再次添加。底层 `h2` 采用 chemist "
"顺序，不再转置。在嵌入固定框架内，`hf_energy` 是参考行列式期望值，不是弛豫后的嵌入 SCF 极小值。静态 MM 和 H₂O 适配器已验证。SQD MC 集成、相关 RDM "
"反馈和可极化 MM 不在本次交付范围内。"

