#: ../../source/sqd.md:162
msgid ""
"T0 cannot be disabled to force a downgrade. Only explicit unavailability, budget exhaustion or "
"controlled timeout permits trying a lower tier. The workflow must report numerical failures. "
"Every non-T0 result carries `baseline_downgrade_reason` and a warning."
msgstr ""
"不得通过禁用 T0 强制降级。仅在明确不可用、预算耗尽或受控超时时，才允许尝试较低层级。工作流必须报告数值失败。每个非 T0 结果均包含 `baseline_downgrade_reason` "
"和警告。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:167
msgid ""
"If uncertainty is unknown, the result records `None` and a reason. It must not record zero. T2 "
"reports the T1 diagnostic, convergence, triples correction and triples/correlation ratio. Flags "
"can mark it untrustworthy. Zero T0 uncertainty excludes basis/model/experimental errors."
msgstr ""
"不确定性未知时，结果记录 `None` 及原因，不得记录零。T2 报告 T1 诊断、收敛、三重激发校正及三重激发 / 相关能比值。标记可将它判为不可信。T0 "
"不确定性为零不包含基组、模型或实验误差。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:172
msgid ""
"Use `baseline_energy`, `baseline_method`, `baseline_tier`, `baseline_uncertainty_mHa`, "
"`baseline_downgrade_reason`, `warnings` and `null_reasons`. Output schema `sqd.result.v1` has 40 "
"fields and writes only canonical `baseline_*` keys. An old `shci_energy` number alone cannot tell"
" whether it came from CASCI or SHCI. Readers must require explicit method, tier, units and "
"uncertainty semantics. They must reject conflicting aliases."
msgstr ""
"使用 "
"`baseline_energy`、`baseline_method`、`baseline_tier`、`baseline_uncertainty_mHa`、`baseline_downgrade_reason`、`warnings`"
" 和 `null_reasons`。输出模式 `sqd.result.v1` 有 40 个字段，只写入规范的 `baseline_*` 键。旧 `shci_energy` 数值本身无法说明它来自"
" CASCI 还是 SHCI。读取方必须要求显式方法、层级、单位和不确定性含义，并拒绝冲突别名。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:179
msgid ""
"Future simple-input consumers should retain the complete result under `sqd`. Future MM callbacks "
"should retain the entire result, not only energy. Those downstream consumers are not claimed as "
"implemented here."
msgstr "未来的简单输入使用方应在 `sqd` 下保留完整结果。未来 MM 回调应保留整个结果，而不仅是能量。此处不声称已实现这些下游使用方。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:183
msgid ""
"`delta_mHa = 1000 * (sqd_energy - baseline_energy)` and `delta_vs_sci_mHa = 1000 * (sqd_energy - "
"iso_ndet_sci_energy)`: positive means SQD is worse. `ratio_sqd_over_sci` is defined only against "
"T0 with a valid nonzero SCI error. SCI and random arms match each spin's subspace dimension. "
"`subspace_dim` is their Cartesian product. `unique_dets_vs_shots` counts sampled pairs and is a "
"different quantity."
msgstr ""
"`delta_mHa = 1000 * (sqd_energy - baseline_energy)` 和 `delta_vs_sci_mHa = 1000 * (sqd_energy - "
"iso_ndet_sci_energy)`：正值表示 SQD 更差。`ratio_sqd_over_sci` 仅在 T0 及有效非零 SCI 误差下定义。SCI "
"和随机分支匹配每种自旋的子空间维数。`subspace_dim` 是其笛卡尔积。`unique_dets_vs_shots` 统计采样对，是另一种量。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:190
msgid ""
"Reference-only outputs have `None` and explicit reasons for unexecuted sampling/comparison "
"fields. `save_json_results` from `q2m3.utils.io` accepts the complete dataclass and preserves "
"these fields. It rejects nonfinite JSON values."
msgstr ""
"仅参考输出对未执行的采样 / 对照字段记录 `None` 和明确原因。`q2m3.utils.io` 中的 `save_json_results` 接受完整数据类，并保留这些字段。它拒绝非有限 "
"JSON 值。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:195
msgid "Resource limits and measured outcomes"
msgstr "资源限制与实测结果"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:197
msgid ""
"The calibrated single-thread Linux model covers balanced closed shells, 2–10 active orbitals, at "
"most 252 determinants per spin and 63504 total, repetitions/batches/iterations at most 2, and "
"shots at most 100000. Other stage-specific input/domain checks still apply. Public "
"diagonalization uses two batches, two iterations and `min(300, shots)` samples per batch. Unknown"
"/out-of-domain bounds raise `ResourceModelDomainError` before the allocation. `allow_large` "
"cannot bypass the domain, host or hard cap."
msgstr ""
"校准的单线程 Linux 模型覆盖平衡闭壳层、2–10 个活性轨道、每种自旋至多 252 个行列式及总共至多 63504 个行列式，重复数 / 批次数 / 迭代数至多为 2，采样数至多为 "
"100000。各阶段的其他输入和域检查仍然适用。公开对角化使用两批、两次迭代，每批 `min(300, shots)` 个样本。未知或域外边界会在分配前抛出 "
"`ResourceModelDomainError`。`allow_large` 不能绕过域、主机或硬上限。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:205
msgid ""
"Predicted RSS at 2048 MB warns, at 8192 MB normally rejects, and at 12288 MB always rejects. "
"Equality to the host or a tighter user cap also rejects. These are decimal MB, separate from the "
"benchmark criterion `peak_bytes < 2_000_000_000`."
msgstr ""
"预测 RSS 达到 2048 MB 时警告，达到 8192 MB 时通常拒绝，达到 12288 MB 时始终拒绝。等于主机上限或更严格用户上限时也会拒绝。这些是十进制 MB，与基准准则 "
"`peak_bytes < 2_000_000_000` 不同。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:210
msgid ""
"The approved default benchmark scope used reps 2/shots 100000. All eight runs used T0, and their "
"measured whole-process-tree peaks were below 2 billion bytes (maximum 1,021,018,112 bytes). "
"Sampling alone peaked at 732,467,200 bytes. Measurements used 10 ms polling and do not guarantee "
"capture of every instantaneous peak or certify arbitrary geometries, MM systems, plugins or T2 "
"paths."
msgstr ""
"获准的默认基准范围使用重复数 2、采样数 100000。全部八次运行使用 T0，实测完整进程树峰值均低于 20 亿字节（最高 1,021,018,112 字节）。仅采样阶段的峰值为 "
"732,467,200 字节。测量使用 10 ms 轮询，不能保证捕获每个瞬时峰值，也不认证任意几何、MM 体系、插件或 T2 路径。"

