#: ../../source/sqd.md:224
msgid ""
"These deltas use each run's own Hamiltonian/frame/core reference. Historical absolute energies "
"must not be mixed into them. Historical Glycine reps 4/shots 200000 and N₂ reps 4/shots 500000 "
"are rejected as out of domain. Their energy and full-run memory benchmarks remain unmeasured. "
"Rejecting a run before execution does not constitute a successful memory benchmark."
msgstr ""
"这些差值使用每次运行自身的哈密顿量 / 轨道框架 / 核心参考，不得混入历史绝对能量。历史甘氨酸重复数 4 / 采样数 200000 及 N₂ 重复数 4 / 采样数 500000 "
"被作为域外请求拒绝。其能量和完整运行内存基准仍未测量。执行前拒绝运行不构成成功的内存基准。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:230
msgid ""
"E1 (four orbital bases) and E6 (restricted connectivity) remain **inconclusive** because their "
"original numerical matrices exceed the certified domain. E1 requires all per-seed and mean ranges"
" to lie strictly on one side of 2 mHa for a directional conclusion. Missing points cannot pass. "
"E6 compares restricted-minus-full errors per seed against 5 mHa. Missing points or threshold "
"crossings are inconclusive."
msgstr ""
"E1（四种轨道基底）和 E6（受限连通性）仍然**无定论**，因为其原始数值矩阵超出认证域。E1 要求所有单种子和均值范围均严格位于 2 mHa "
"的同一侧，才能得出方向性结论。缺失点不能通过。E6 将每个种子的受限减完整误差与 5 mHa 比较。缺失点或跨越阈值均无定论。"

#: ../../source/sqd.md:237
msgid ""
"Verified nontrivial H₃O⁺ connectivity consumption proves the operator uses its inputs, not energy"
" superiority or hardware readiness. No hardware layout, SWAP, noise or ancilla certification is "
"implied. E3 was not run in this delivery and must not be labeled complete."
msgstr "已验证非平凡 H₃O⁺ 连通性被使用，只能证明算符使用了输入，不能证明能量更优或已具备硬件运行条件。它不包含硬件布局、SWAP、噪声或辅助量子比特认证。E3 在本次交付中未运行，不得标为完成。"

